{title: Almost Persuaded}
{artist: Philip Bliss}
{key: C}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: 69}

Verse 1
"Al[C]most persuaded" [F]now to be[C]lieve; "al[C]most persuaded" [G]Christ to receive:
[C]seems now some soul to [F]say, "Go, [C]Spirit, [G]go thy way —
some [C]more con[F]venient [C]day on [G]thee I'll [C]call."
